:"Introduction","source":{"current_hash_method":"tex-environment-body-comments-removed","current_statement_sha256":"sha256:aec7179eb32282d951db7bf363a549fcb46702f2b8c00400d4932fdf09425cc8","file":"preprints/Exponential-PSD-rank-of-positively-shifted-matching-matrices-October-5-2026/build/source/sections/introduction.tex","line":74,"producer_hash_method":"atlas-whitespace-normalized-text","producer_statement_sha256":"a2aa75ba143d73c86be46821e69f7df8ecd5f854755d2d0f2a0163a3aad78094","provenance":{"kind":"computed","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","source":"preprints/Exponential-PSD-rank-of-positively-shifted-matching-matrices-October-5-2026/build/source/sections/introduction.tex"},"sha256":"sha256:aec7179eb32282d951db7bf363a549fcb46702f2b8c00400d4932fdf09425cc8","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/Exponential-PSD-rank-of-positively-shifted-matching-matrices-October-5-2026/build/source/sections/introduction.tex#L74"},"statement_kind":"corollary","text":"\\label{cor:exact-lift}\nThere are constants $c_0>0$ and $n_1$ such that, for every even\n$n\\ge n_1$, both $A_n(0)$ and $T_n(0)$ have real PSD rank at least\n$2^{c_0n}$, and every exact semidefinite lift of $P_n$ has size at\nleast $2^{c_0n}$."}
